{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3f8e1c52-7a4b-4d2e-9c61-5b0a2f9d7e13",
    "name": "YouTube Music Playlist Creator",
    "description": "Colección para probar la API de YouTube Music Playlist Creator (v2).\n\n**Base URL:** variable `baseUrl` (por defecto `http://localhost:8000`).\n\n**Autenticación:** la colección usa Bearer `{{token}}`. En modo local (`AUTH_MODE=none`) puedes dejar `token` vacío. Con `AUTH_MODE=supabase`, copia el token desde la UI (menú de usuario → \"Copiar token de API\") y pégalo en la variable `token`.\n\n**Orden sugerido:** Salud → Guardar credenciales YT → Setlists y búsqueda → Playlists → Jobs.\n\nDocumentación interactiva de la API: `/docs` (Swagger) y `/redoc`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Salud y cuenta",
      "description": "Estado de la API y conexión con YouTube Music (cookies/headers del navegador).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "description": "Comprueba que la API responde. No requiere token.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/me",
            "description": "Usuario actual y estado de YouTube Music (`ytmusic.connected`)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Estado credenciales YT",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ytmusic/credentials",
            "description": "Indica si la cuenta de YouTube Music está conectada. Si no lo está, `error` trae el motivo."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Guardar credenciales YT",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ytmusic/credentials",
            "description": "Valida el cURL copiado desde DevTools ('Copy as cURL') y lo guarda si funciona. Responde 422 si las credenciales no sirven. Reemplaza el ejemplo por tu cURL real.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"raw\": \"curl 'https://music.youtube.com/youtubei/v1/browse?...' -H 'authorization: SAPISIDHASH ...' -b '...'\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Borrar credenciales YT",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ytmusic/credentials",
            "description": "Elimina las credenciales guardadas del usuario. Responde 204."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Setlists y búsqueda",
      "description": "Interpreta una fuente sin tocar YouTube Music y busca canciones individuales.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Analizar setlist (texto)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/setlists/parse",
            "description": "Convierte texto (una canción por línea, `Artista - Canción`) en un Setlist. No escribe nada.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"text\": \"Oasis - Wonderwall\\nBlur - Song 2\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Analizar setlist (setlist.fm)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/setlists/parse",
            "description": "Lee artista, evento y canciones desde una URL de setlist.fm. Cambia la URL por la de tu concierto.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"setlistfm\",\n  \"url\": \"https://www.setlist.fm/setlist/the-hives/2025/teatro-caupolican-santiago-chile-1234abcd.html\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar canción",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=Oasis%20-%20Wonderwall",
            "description": "Busca la mejor coincidencia para una canción. Responde `track: null` si no hay resultados."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Playlists",
      "description": "Crea una playlist o agrega canciones a una existente. Devuelve un job (202) para seguir el progreso.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear desde lista (songs)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/playlists",
            "description": "Crea una playlist privada desde una lista explícita. Guarda el `jobId` para la petición 'Ver job'.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"source\": {\n    \"type\": \"songs\",\n    \"songs\": [\n      \"Oasis - Wonderwall\",\n      \"Blur - Song 2\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"name\": \"Britpop\",\n  \"privacy\": \"PRIVATE\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jobId\", pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear desde texto",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/playlists",
            "description": "Crea una playlist no listada desde texto libre (una canción por línea).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"source\": {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"text\": \"Oasis - Hello\\nOasis - Acquiesce\\nBilly Idol - Rebel Yell\"\n  },\n  \"name\": \"Setlist desde texto\",\n  \"privacy\": \"UNLISTED\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear desde setlist.fm",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/playlists",
            "description": "Crea una playlist pública a partir de una URL de setlist.fm. Requiere credenciales de YouTube Music.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"source\": {\n    \"type\": \"setlistfm\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.setlist.fm/setlist/the-hives/2025/teatro-caupolican-santiago-chile-1234abcd.html\"\n  },\n  \"privacy\": \"PUBLIC\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Agregar a playlist existente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/playlists",
            "description": "Agrega las canciones a una playlist que ya existe. `playlist_id` acepta el ID o la URL de la playlist.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"source\": {\n    \"type\": \"songs\",\n    \"songs\": [\n      \"Oasis - Wonderwall\",\n      \"Blur - Song 2\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"playlist_id\": \"PLxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Dry run (solo buscar)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/playlists",
            "description": "Solo busca las canciones y muestra el resultado. No escribe en YouTube Music, así que no requiere credenciales.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"source\": {\n    \"type\": \"songs\",\n    \"songs\": [\n      \"Oasis - Wonderwall\",\n      \"Blur - Song 2\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"dry_run\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear con wait=true",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/playlists?wait=true",
            "description": "Espera a que termine el job y responde 200 con el resultado final. Práctico en Postman.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"source\": {\n    \"type\": \"songs\",\n    \"songs\": [\n      \"Oasis - Wonderwall\",\n      \"Blur - Song 2\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"name\": \"Britpop\",\n  \"privacy\": \"PRIVATE\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Jobs",
      "description": "Seguimiento de los jobs creados por la API (en memoria; se pierden si la instancia se reinicia).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar jobs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs",
            "description": "Jobs del usuario, más recientes primero, sin el detalle por canción."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver job",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}",
            "description": "Detalle de un job: `status`, `summary` y `items`. Usa la variable `jobId` (la guarda 'Crear desde lista')."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
